    (3) **Second-summand rank-1 factorisation**:
        `osGramSummand2_3p1 t x = (osColVec2_3p1 t x) *
                                   (osColVec2_3p1 t x)ᵀ`.

    (4) **Rank-2 PSD certificate**: for ANY `n` and any spacetime
        parameters, `(osGramMatrix3p1Rank2 t x).PosSemidef`, via
        `Matrix.PosSemidef.add` on the two rank-1 summands.

    (5) **Hermiticity of the rank-2 Gram matrix** as a consequence
        of PSD.

    (6) **Diagonal positivity (rank-2)**: each diagonal entry
