    (7) **Linear independence of the two test states** (rank-2-
        specific clause): the determinant of the 2×2 test-state
        matrix at `t = (0, 1)` is `e^{-2} - e^{-1} < 0`, so the two
        column vectors `osColVec1_3p1, osColVec2_3p1` span a genuine
