    **What this extension demonstrably ADDS to Wave 50D**: the FIRST
    rank-≥ 2 OS PSD certificate in the PF YM-toy ladder. The pattern
    `M_k = Σ_{j=1}^k v_j · v_jᵀ` for `k` linearly-independent test
    states extends by induction via `Matrix.PosSemidef.add`. Wave 51D
    realises this at `k = 2`, the first non-trivial multi-particle
